B 0x8D7C This piece does not chase anybody: it follows a fixed route, written as
B 0x8D7C twelve steps. Each one adds a constant speed (two signed bytes) and
B 0x8D7C waits for it to reach an exact coordinate; when it gets there, it moves
B 0x8D7C on to the next step. The only one that looks at the ship is 0x0A, which
B 0x8D7C chooses which way to go before carrying on.
