B 0x9955 THE SHIP'S DRAWING COMES FROM WHAT IS BEING PRESSED
B 0x9955 The ship has no animation: its drawing is a function of the two low bits
B 0x9955 of the joystick (up and down), which index a table of four-byte cards.
B 0x9955 And there are three different tables depending on what you are playing
B 0x9955 with: the normal one, and two others that are only used if 0xF0F4 is
B 0x9955 set, that is, if at start-up the other Konami cartridge was found in the
B 0x9955 machine.
